-The AAL77 (**7596160**), UAL93 (**7597164**) and UAL175 (**7598471**) copies have different whole-PDF hashes. All three have identical corresponding page geometry, grayscale raster samples and sorted extracted text on each of their three pages in PyMuPDF 1.27.2.2 at 115 dpi. The AAL11 copy (**7597932**) is listed as redacted. Its three pages differ in the same raster and text checks from the other group. Visual checks of the selected areas on pp. 1–2 in 7596160 and 7597932 show the same two 0924 entries. The four accessions supply dependent copies of the account. The comparison does not classify every differing pixel or assign a revision order. [NARA finding aid, box 96](https://www.archives.gov/research/foia/faa-finding-aid-96-107) · [AAL77 copy](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7596160) · [AAL11 copy](https://catalog.archives.gov/id/7597932)
